'''Fantastic Adventure''' (Chinese: '''奇異冒險''' ''Kèihyih Mouhhím'') is the third opening theme of the Cantonese dub of {{aniseries|PTS}}, used between [[EP160]] to [[EP259]]. It is a remix of [[With You Accompanying Me]]. The lyrics of the song are based on [[Aim to Be a Pokémon Master]]. The opening animation uses footage from the third Japanese opening, [[OK!]] ([[EP160]] – [[EP207]]) and the fourth Japanese opening, Aim to Be a Pokémon Master (Whiteberry Version) ([[EP208]] – [[EP259]]). 

==Opening animation ([[EP160]] – [[EP207]])==
===Synopsis===
A [[Poké Ball]] appears on the screen with silhouettes of Pokémon encircling it. The Pokémon logo then appears. {{Ash}} is seen running. {{AP|Pikachu}} appears running with him. {{an|Misty}} (holding {{TP|Misty|Togepi}}), then {{an|Brock}} later appears running alongside them. {{p|Ho-Oh}} and {{p|Lugia}} are flying in the sky. The group is seen in the wild, running pass several {{p|Sentret}}. They later runs into a forest. {{p|Spinarak}}, {{p|Hoothoot}}, and three {{p|Murkrow}} are on a tree. They are passing across a river, with multiple {{p|Quagsire}} in it. A {{p|Slowpoke}}, {{p|Slowbro}}, and {{p|Slowking}} are on rocks, and a {{p|Marill}} jumps out of the water. They are playing on grass. Multiple {{p|Ledyba}} fly into the sky. [[Gary Oak]] appears with his {{TP|Gary|Eevee}} on the screen. {{p|Bellossom}} are seen dancing, and an {{p|Elekid}} swings by. Ash, Misty, and Brock are seen at a picnic with their Pokémon. Pikachu, {{AP|Chikorita}}, {{AP|Cyndaquil}}, and {{AP|Totodile}} are with Ash. Flashbacks of [[Delia Ketchum]], [[Mimey]], {{an|Professor Oak}}, {{Tracey}}, [[Officer Jenny]], [[Nurse Joy]] and {{TP|Nurse Joy|Chansey}} appear. {{p|Mewtwo}} and {{p|Mew}} are seen. {{p|Suicune}}'s silhouette appears. {{TP|Madame Muchmoney|Snubbull}} bites {{MTR}}'s tail, while he runs, circling [[Jessie]] and [[James]]. {{an|Jigglypuff}} appears singing, and {{TRT}} fall asleep. {{AP|Heracross}}, Pikachu, Ledyba, Togepi, and Hoothoot appear. Ash is in a stadium, standing beside Misty and Brock, looking at an unknown {{pkmn|Trainer}}. Chikorita, Totodile, and Cyndaquil are seen using their [[move]]s. Ash is with Pikachu, and Pikachu jumps off Ash's hand while using {{m|Thunderbolt}}. Ash and {{ashfr}} are seen with lots of Pokémon.

