===Synopsis===
{{Ash}} is holding a [[Poké Ball]] and tosses it towards the screen. In a stadium, a {{p|Tyranitar}} uses {{m|Hyper Beam}} on {{AP|Pikachu}}. Pikachu dodges it and uses {{m|Thunderbolt}}. Ash and {{ashfr}} are then seen jumping into the water. In the water, a {{p|Mantine}}, two {{p|Lanturn}}, a {{p|Lapras}}, and a {{p|Lugia}} swim across the screen. Ash turns his {{AP|hat}} and faces left while holding a Poké Ball.

This is followed by Ash and Pikachu running with {{an|Ho-Oh}} flying in the sky. Ho-Oh disappears toward the mountain. Ash appears on screen with a stadium in the back. Clips of his Pokémon appear on the screen. A scene then follows, showing Ash, his Pokémon, {{an|Misty}}, and {{an|Brock}} looking at a city. The [[Legendary beasts]] and {{p|Celebi}} are shown on a mountaintop, and {{p|Mewtwo}} and {{p|Mew}} are shown in a city at night.

Ash and the others are then shown walking in a cave where {{p|Crobat}} and {{p|Misdreavus}} appear. Ash and the others stood at a bridge, with several {{p|Hoppip}} in the sky. Then, the [[Pichu Brothers]] are shown under the bridge. After that, Ash tried to chase after his Pokémon. Then, Team Rocket chased after Ash and his friends. Finally, Ash and his friends chased after Team Rocket with {{TP|Misty|Togepi}} in front of them.

The screen then switches to four [[Baby Pokémon]], {{Tracey}}, {{an|Professor Oak}}, [[Delia Ketchum]], [[Officer Jenny]], and [[Nurse Joy]], with {{AP|Larvitar}} in front of them. Ash and Pikachu ran up a flight of stairs together with the [[legendary birds]] and reached the [[Indigo Plateau]]. Ash and Pikachu stood in front of many Pokémon. Finally, Ash, his Pokémon, Misty, and Brock stood together.

